# CR 614.1 / 615: a prevention replacement. Bubble Matrix's
# R:Event$ DamageDone | ValidTarget$ Creature | Prevent$ True stops all damage
# that would be dealt to creatures. Silvercoat Lion (2/2) is blocked by Grizzly
# Bears (2/2): without the artifact both would die in the regular damage step;
# with it neither is damaged and both survive.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
